titanfall2-apple: notices

titanfall2-apple is based on titanfall2-mac (https://github.com/rkutyna/titanfall2-mac, MIT).

This repository's own code and documents are under the MIT License (LICENSE), except as listed here.

- patches/dxmt/*.patch and patches/dxmt-ios/*.patch: changes to DXMT (https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt), which is free software under the
  GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version. The patches are
  under the same licence. DXMT itself is not in this repository: `./tfrecomp setup` clones it.
- runtime/com/desc/*.idef: lists of Direct3D 11, DXGI, XAudio2 and MMDevice interface names, interface IDs,
  method order and parameter types, generated by runtime/com/gen_desc.py from the MinGW-w64 headers and
  Wine 10.0's IDL files (Wine: LGPL 2.1 or later). Only those interface facts are recorded; no header text.
- Python packages used at build and test time, installed by `./tfrecomp setup` and not included here:
  capstone (BSD) and unicorn (GPL-2.0).
- tools/shaderxc builds against Unity's HLSLcc (MIT), which it expects in third_party/ and does not include.
- The iOS build compiles LLVM 15.0.7 (Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions), which the build instructions
  download into third_party/; no LLVM code is in this repository.
- tools/ios/*/project.yml are XcodeGen (MIT) specifications; XcodeGen is not included.
- tools/ios/fetch-engine.command runs DepotDownloader (GPL-2.0), which the user installs; it is not included.

